OL,3,GNEWSASearch and rescue dog given animal
OL,4,AOBE after death                        
OL,6,FA search and rescue dog who helped to  
OL,7,Fsave missing people for11 years has bee
OL,8,Fgiven an award dubbed the "OBE for     
OL,9,Fanimals" two months after his death.   
OL,11,FCain, who joined Search Dogs Sussex in 
OL,12,FJune 2013 at 18-months-old, helped to  
OL,13,Fsave people across difficult terrain   
OL,14,Fand in difficult scenarios, going from 
OL,15,Fbeing the group's youngest recruit to  
OL,16,Fits longest serving dog.               
OL,18,FThe border collie has now posthumously 
OL,19,Fbeen given the PDSA Order of Merit, an 
OL,20,Faward which recognises the "special    
OL,21,Frelationship between animals and       
OL,22,Fhumans", the charity says.             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
