OL,3,GNEWSASearch and rescue dog given animal
OL,4,AOBE after death                        
OL,6,FCain's handler, Steve Ball, said: "He  
OL,7,Fwas an extraordinary dog, not just in  
OL,8,Fhis work but as part of our family. He 
OL,9,Fwill always be very special to us."    
